      "id": "CVE-2026-54431",
      "publishedDate": "2026-07-02T10:30:57.655Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-07-02T10:30:57.655Z",
      "description": "In liboauth2 the Demonstrating Proof-of-Possession (DPoP) verifier accepts a proof whose JSON Web Key (jwk) header contains private key material. RFC 9449 section 4.3 step 7 requires the verifier to reject such a proof but oauth2_token_verify() function returns success for a malformed DPoP proof that embeds the private Elliptic Curve (EC) key in the header.\n\nThis issue was fixed in version 2.3.0",
      "severity": "N/A",
